From 9d2f5d2701d75ea144825ba1c421e599e29b4994 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Keith Packard <keithp@keithp.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 08:03:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/10] test-posix: Check <ndbm.h>, dbm_open's flags and files,
 and the records

Add test-ndbm_h (datum, the store modes, prototypes, namespace),
test-dbm_open (where the files go, their mode and owner, O_CREAT,
O_EXCL, O_TRUNC, O_RDONLY, O_WRONLY and O_CLOEXEC) and test-dbm_store
(DBM_INSERT and DBM_REPLACE, binary keys, 1023-byte pairs, the key
walk and a 20000-record database). The -native builds are skipped
when the C library has no <ndbm.h>.
